      "created_at": "2025-06-18T22:10:49.007Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/janniesander\">@JannieSander</a></p>\n<p><strong>Fee Schedule</strong> can create Fees for a Program (Class) where Student Groups (Sections) can be picked and chosen and based on Fee Categories (Fee Types) as below;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/b/dbfbaf9e2dd6637f54bae7b0124df99ad724c830.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/dbfbaf9e2dd6637f54bae7b0124df99ad724c830\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/b/dbfbaf9e2dd6637f54bae7b0124df99ad724c830_2_690x453.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vo3NEjYibQNToXkhXOOGkNmskuY\" width=\"690\" height=\"453\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/b/dbfbaf9e2dd6637f54bae7b0124df99ad724c830_2_690x453.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/b/dbfbaf9e2dd6637f54bae7b0124df99ad724c830_2_1035x679.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/b/dbfbaf9e2dd6637f54bae7b0124df99ad724c830.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1191×782 40 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>You can define your courses as fee categories and run them in fee schedule to create fees subsequently.</p>",
